# Secrets — never bake provider keys into the image; inject at runtime.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Frontend and legacy code are not part of the API image.
apps/web
**/node_modules
**/.next
api_legacy
apps/api_legacy

# Local tooling / caches
.git
.venv
venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
.claude
*.db
*.md
!README.md
**/data/*.db
**/data/*.txt
**/data/*.db-*
